# Row I1.7: the lead's plan. Only the lead of the round writes it. A body of {} writes nothing: the lead is answered 400.
# Wen cannot see Hugo's round at all (404); Hugo sits on Wen's round and is refused in words (403, not the lead);
# the recruiter and the hiring manager hold no ConductInterview. (The panel round is named by its seeded id: a table path only
# resolves {group.name}, and panelInterview is a top-level seed id. Harness gap, reported.)
PUT /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.nadiaDesign}/questions      | interviewer2 recruiter=403 hiringManager=403 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | interviewer | {}
PUT /api/interviews/interviews/iv-n5z9f2cq/questions   | interviewer=403 recruiter=403 hiringManager=403 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | interviewer2 | {}
